  "instructions": [
    "Heat the broth in a kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add the galangal, lemongrass, and black pepper to the broth and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced bellflower root to the broth and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the ssam wrap pieces to the broth and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the fish sauce, sugar, and coconut milk.",
    "Simmer the porridge for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Ladle the porridge into bowls and garnish with chopped green onions."
